{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const useForm: UseFormHook<DefaultReactFormComponentMap>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/ReactForm/useForm.public.ts#L62","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-form/src/ReactForm/useForm.public.ts:62"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a React form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\ncomponent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":" establish the initial state and inferred form value type.\nLater renders apply changed options to the same form instance, and unmounting\nthe component cleans it up."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call this hook at the top level of a React component or custom hook."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(event) => {\n        event.preventDefault()\n        void form.handleSubmit()\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The React form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst useForm: UseFormHook<DefaultReactFormComponentMap>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/ReactForm/useForm.public.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/ReactForm/useForm.public.ts#L62)\n\nCreates a React form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\ncomponent.\n\n`defaultValues` establish the initial state and inferred form value type.\nLater renders apply changed options to the same form instance, and unmounting\nthe component cleans it up.\n\nCall this hook at the top level of a React component or custom hook.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(event) => {\n        event.preventDefault()\n        void form.handleSubmit()\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Returns\n\nThe React form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useForm\ntitle: useForm\n---\n\n```ts\nconst useForm: UseFormHook<DefaultReactFormComponentMap>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/ReactForm/useForm.public.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/ReactForm/useForm.public.ts#L62)\n\nCreates a React form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\ncomponent.\n\n`defaultValues` establish the initial state and inferred form value type.\nLater renders apply changed options to the same form instance, and unmounting\nthe component cleans it up.\n\nCall this hook at the top level of a React component or custom hook.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(event) => {\n        event.preventDefault()\n        void form.handleSubmit()\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Returns\n\nThe React form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached.\n"}
